          "type": "TCHAR*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Package Namespace",
          "type": "TCHAR*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "TCHAR*",
      "docs": "Attempt to parse this text history from the given stream of text.\n@param Buffer\t\t\tThe buffer of text to read from.\n@param TextNamespace\t\tAn optional namespace to use when parsing texts that use LOCTEXT (default is an empty namespace).\n@param PackageNamespace\tThe package namespace of the containing object (if loading for a property - see TextNamespaceUtil::GetPackageNamespace).\n@param OutDisplayString\tThe display string pointer to potentially fill in (depending on the history type).\n@return The updated buffer after we parsed this text history, or nullptr on failure"
    },
